---
import PortfolioLayout from '../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro';
import WorkCard from '../components/WorkCard.astro';
import marginCover from '../assets/margin/cover.png';
---
<PortfolioLayout home>
<main id="top">

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-shape" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div>
        <span class="badge">Charlottesville, VA · open to remote, DC &amp; Richmond</span>
        <h1>From courses to cohorts to credentials, I've got it covered.</h1>
        <p class="lede">I'm Michael Muñoz — a learning designer and strategist. I build the programs, not just the courses inside them: the stakeholder buy-in, the delivery model, the feedback loop that makes people want to come back for the next one.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-solid" href="#portfolio">See the work</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#contact">Let's talk</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-stack" aria-hidden="false">
        <div class="stat-card sc-1"><div class="num">15,000+</div><div class="label">employees reached through a single quality-training redesign</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card sc-2"><div class="num">70+</div><div class="label">staff directed across eight leadership learning experiences</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card sc-3"><div class="num">92 NPS</div><div class="label">learner satisfaction on a two-week AI-accelerated build</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="torn" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <section class="about" id="about">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h2>Learning strategy, built by someone who still builds.</h2>
        <p>I've spent the last decade moving between the whiteboard and the build — setting learning strategy with senior stakeholders, then getting into the design work myself when a program needs it. That combination is the thing I bring: I can sit in a room with a VP and scope a leadership program, then sit down with a designer and fix the scenario that isn't landing.</p>
        <p>Most recently I've been a design leader within PwC's Advisory line of service — leadership development, onboarding, and managed-services training — while running my own consulting practice since 2017.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fact-list">
        <div class="fact"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>M.Ed., Curriculum &amp; Instruction</strong><span>George Mason University</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>8+ years</strong><span>leading learning design &amp; delivery, agency to enterprise</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Generative AI, hands-on</strong><span>Claude, Copilot &amp; ChatGPT built into the design workflow, not bolted on</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="dot"></span><div><strong>Michael Muñoz LLC</strong><span>Independent consulting practice, President since 2017</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="capabilities" id="capabilities">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>What I do</h2>
        <p>The work spans strategy and hands-on build. Here's where I'm strongest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cap-grid">
        <div class="cap-card">Learning Strategy &amp; Needs Assessment</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Stakeholder Management &amp; Business Partnership</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Program &amp; Portfolio Management</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Cross-Functional Team Leadership</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Coaching &amp; Mentoring</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Learning Experience Design</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Leadership Development</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Learning Analytics &amp; Program Evaluation</div>
        <div class="cap-card">Generative AI for Learning Design</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience" id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Where I've done it</h2>
        <p>The short version of an eight-year run through agency, enterprise, and government L&amp;D.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline">

        <div class="tl-item left">
          <span class="tl-dot"></span>
          <span class="tl-date">Jan 2025 – Present</span>
          <h3>PwC</h3>
          <div class="role">Learning Designer</div>
          <p>Lead design and delivery across leadership development, onboarding, and Managed Services. Directed 70+ staff across eight leadership experiences and built a self-paced onboarding pathway for new joiners.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item right">
          <span class="tl-dot"></span>
          <span class="tl-date">Sep 2024 – Feb 2025</span>
          <h3>Capital One</h3>
          <div class="role">Senior Training Developer</div>
          <p>Managed ISO 20022 learning assets for 1,000+ associates against fixed regulatory deadlines, coordinating SMEs and brand partners across business lines.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item left">
          <span class="tl-dot"></span>
          <span class="tl-date">Apr 2022 – Jul 2024</span>
          <h3>PwC · ProEdge</h3>
          <div class="role">Learning Content Program Manager</div>
          <p>Managed a 10,000+ asset learning portfolio. Led workflow changes that cut time-to-market by 33% and reduced downstream support tickets by 15%.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item right">
          <span class="tl-dot"></span>
          <span class="tl-date">Jul 2020 – Apr 2022</span>
          <h3>AP Ventures</h3>
          <div class="role">Senior Storyline Developer / Instructional Designer</div>
          <p>Led a team of four designers and developers. Built and reviewed technical training for military and federal clients, including courses with hundreds of slides.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tl-item left">
          <span class="tl-dot"></span>
          <span class="tl-date">Apr 2018 – Jul 2020</span>
          <h3>ManTech International</h3>
          <div class="role">Lead Instructional Systems Designer</div>
          <p>Sole instructional designer supporting 8,000+ employees. Introduced tooling and templates that cut development time by 25%.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio" id="portfolio">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Selected work</h2>
        <p>Three perspectives on learning: experience design, program design, and learning architecture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="port-grid">
        <WorkCard title="The Margin" category="Learning Experience Design" href="/work/the-margin" image={marginCover} imageAlt="The Margin field-journal cover with pressed blue flowers" summary="An interactive field journal for practicing judgment under changing conditions. Explore the design, then take the trail as Eli Torres." />
        <WorkCard title="Delivery Lead Bootcamp" category="Leadership Development" href="/work/delivery-lead-bootcamp" summary="A pilot leadership bootcamp designed to surface questions about the operating model, technology, and delivery assumptions before full development. Case study coming soon." />
        <WorkCard title="CT&I Learning Architecture & Strategy" category="Learning Strategy" href="/work/cti-learning-architecture" summary="A look at learning architecture and strategy. The project context, design approach, and supporting artifacts will be added in the full case study." />
      </div>
      <div class="port-note">The Margin is available to explore now. Delivery Lead Bootcamp and CT&amp;I Learning Architecture &amp; Strategy case studies are coming soon.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="community" id="community">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head" style="color:var(--cream);">
        <h2 style="color:var(--cream);">Beyond the day job</h2>
        <p style="color:#D8C4AC;">Two things I care about outside a client engagement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comm-grid">
        <div class="postcard">
          <h3>Co-Founder, Rawr for Kian</h3>
          <p>A nonprofit supporting pediatric cancer research and families in treatment. Since 2021, the organization has raised $150,000+ for research, delivered 150+ meals to hospitals, and provided $3,000+ in direct family assistance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="postcard">
          <h3>Community Leader, r/InstructionalDesign &amp; ID Discord</h3>
          <p>Help lead a 50,000+ member learning-design community since 2017 — setting guidelines and working with a global moderator team to keep the space useful and respectful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Got a program that needs building?</h2>
      <p>Open to remote work, and to Richmond or Washington, DC metro roles.</p>
      <div class="contact-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-solid" href="mailto:mikemunoz@gmail.com">mikemunoz@gmail.com</a>
        <a class="btn" href="tel:7039639248">703-963-9248</a>
        <a class="btn" href="https://linkedin.com/in/michaellxd/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
</PortfolioLayout>
